--- Adopt command (brownfield entry point) ---
Brownfield adoption stages A0-A11

Usage: gov adopt [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  baseline          
  inventory         
  classify          
  map               
  plan              
  test-design       
  review            
  migrate           
  verify-migration  
  extract-legacy    
  build-memory      
  verify-memory     
  audit             
  status            
  rollback          
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --root <ROOT>        Repository root (default: discovered from the current directory)
      --json               Structured JSON output envelope
      --session <SESSION>  Session id (default: $GOV_SESSION or a new id)
      --role <ROLE>        Acting role (default: $GOV_ROLE or orchestrator)
  -h, --help               Print help

